IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `ei7-related-nouns`
IMPORT `ei7-related-2012-2015`

-- Tests of ei7-related-2012-2015. Every expected value is written by hand from the text of the related provision
-- named above it (src:3763-3793). The days that an amending Act leaves to "the day on which ... come into force" are
-- not in the deposited text, so the days used for them are chosen to test the boundary and are not the real days.

§ `2012, c. 19, s. 616`

#ASSERT `Act RP 2012 c. 19 s. 616 section 14 as amended by section 604 applies to the claimant` (YMD 2013 4 7)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2012 c. 19 s. 616 section 14 as amended by section 604 applies to the claimant` (YMD 2020 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2012 c. 19 s. 616 section 14 as amended by section 604 applies to the claimant` (YMD 2013 4 6))

§ `2012, c. 27, s. 32`

-- the day is taken as Sunday, December 2, 2012.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 32 sections 18, 21 and 152.03 as amended apply to the claim` `a prescribed illness, injury or quarantine` (YMD 2012 12 2) (YMD 2012 12 2)
#ASSERT `Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 32 sections 18, 21 and 152.03 as amended apply to the claim` `a prescribed illness, injury or quarantine` (YMD 2012 12 9) (YMD 2012 12 2)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 32 sections 18, 21 and 152.03 as amended apply to the claim` `a prescribed illness, injury or quarantine` (YMD 2012 11 25) (YMD 2012 12 2))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 32 sections 18, 21 and 152.03 as amended apply to the claim` `pregnancy` (YMD 2012 12 9) (YMD 2012 12 2))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 32 sections 18, 21 and 152.03 as amended apply to the claim` `a reason other than those mentioned in subsection 12(3)` (YMD 2012 12 9) (YMD 2012 12 2))

§ `2012, c. 27, s. 33`

-- (a) a benefit period beginning on the day.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 33 sections 23.2 and 152.061 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2012 12 2), (YMD 2013 11 30)) (YMD 2012 12 2) (YMD 2012 12 2)
-- (b) a benefit period that began the day before and has not ended: only weeks that begin on or after the day.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 33 sections 23.2 and 152.061 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2012 12 1), (YMD 2013 11 30)) (YMD 2012 12 2) (YMD 2012 12 2)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 33 sections 23.2 and 152.061 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2012 12 1), (YMD 2013 11 30)) (YMD 2012 11 25) (YMD 2012 12 2))
-- a benefit period whose last day is the day itself has not ended before it.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 33 sections 23.2 and 152.061 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2012 6 1), (YMD 2012 12 2)) (YMD 2012 12 2) (YMD 2012 12 2)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2012 c. 27 s. 33 sections 23.2 and 152.061 apply to the week of benefits` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2012 6 1), (YMD 2012 12 1)) (YMD 2012 12 2) (YMD 2012 12 2))

§ `2013, c. 35, s. 4`

-- the day is Saturday, June 1, 2013. The week of Sunday, May 19 ends on Saturday, May 25: wholly before the day.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2013 c. 35 s. 4 paragraphs 10(10)(a) and 152.11(11)(a) do not apply to the week` (YMD 2013 5 19) TRUE (YMD 2013 6 1)
-- the week of Sunday, May 26 ends on the day itself, which is not before it.
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2013 c. 35 s. 4 paragraphs 10(10)(a) and 152.11(11)(a) do not apply to the week` (YMD 2013 5 26) TRUE (YMD 2013 6 1))
-- a week of no confinement.
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2013 c. 35 s. 4 paragraphs 10(10)(a) and 152.11(11)(a) do not apply to the week` (YMD 2013 5 19) FALSE (YMD 2013 6 1))

§ `2014, c. 20, s. 250`

#ASSERT `Act RP 2014 c. 20 s. 250 subsections 18(2) and 152.03(1.1) as enacted apply to the claim` `a prescribed illness, injury or quarantine` (YMD 2014 12 7) (YMD 2014 12 7)
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2014 c. 20 s. 250 subsections 18(2) and 152.03(1.1) as enacted apply to the claim` `a prescribed illness, injury or quarantine` (YMD 2014 11 30) (YMD 2014 12 7))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2014 c. 20 s. 250 subsections 18(2) and 152.03(1.1) as enacted apply to the claim` `care or support of a family member` (YMD 2015 1 4) (YMD 2014 12 7))

§ `2015, c. 36, s. 79`

-- (1) began before January 3, 2016 and has not ended.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2015 c. 36 s. 79(1) sections 12 and 23.1 as they read on January 3, 2016 apply to the claimant from that day` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2015 12 1), (YMD 2016 2 1))
-- began on January 3, 2016: not before it.
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2015 c. 36 s. 79(1) sections 12 and 23.1 as they read on January 3, 2016 apply to the claimant from that day` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2016 1 3), (YMD 2016 4 3)))
-- ended on January 2, 2016: ended before that day.
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2015 c. 36 s. 79(1) sections 12 and 23.1 as they read on January 3, 2016 apply to the claimant from that day` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2015 11 1), (YMD 2016 1 2)))
-- last day January 3, 2016: has not ended before that day.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2015 c. 36 s. 79(1) sections 12 and 23.1 as they read on January 3, 2016 apply to the claimant from that day` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2015 11 1), (YMD 2016 1 3))
-- (2) the same for a self-employed person.
#ASSERT `Act RP 2015 c. 36 s. 79(2) sections 152.06 and 152.14 as they read on January 3, 2016 apply to the self-employed person from that day` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2015 12 1), (YMD 2016 2 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2015 c. 36 s. 79(2) sections 152.06 and 152.14 as they read on January 3, 2016 apply to the self-employed person from that day` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2016 1 3), (YMD 2016 4 3)))
#ASSERT NOT (`Act RP 2015 c. 36 s. 79(2) sections 152.06 and 152.14 as they read on January 3, 2016 apply to the self-employed person from that day` (`Period of days` OF (YMD 2015 11 1), (YMD 2016 1 2)))
